Chemical Technology I — Indra Deo Mall, NPTEL (@ic-mall-course: 0, is #reference, #part-of @ic-sources) { r_2QDGEANAX8QTGRS531GFVF4H74
I. D. Mall, IIT Roorkee. Chemical Technology I, NPTEL web 103107082 and video 103107081. [Web course](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/103107082) · [Video course](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/103107081) · [Web syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/103107082.pdf) · [Video syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/103107081.pdf).

Use the complete available teaching as a companion process survey: industrial raw materials, reaction and flow accounts, inorganic and organic families, petroleum/coal chemistry, polymers/fibres, and natural-product industries. Both published syllabi describe a 42-hour programme. Compare their actual topics with the Kishore courses rather than assuming the web/video files are identical.

The official syllabi and instructor were verified on 29 October 2026. The old nested archive directory returned 404 and the current portal did not expose every lesson through the browser; universal availability of the historic web chapters is not claimed. Use the verified public courses and complete texts as the main progression when individual links are unavailable. Course media and commercial bibliography retain their own rights and remain external.

